---
import PageShell from "@/components/page/PageShell.astro";
import PageHero from "@/components/page/PageHero.astro";
import Section from "@/components/page/Section.astro";
import CtaBand from "@/components/page/CtaBand.astro";
---

<PageShell title="Why we're ISO-only">
  <PageHero eyebrow="For ISOs" title="Why we work only through brokers">
    <p>We have no sales floor and no direct-to-merchant channel. Every deal we fund comes from a broker.</p>
  </PageHero>

  <Section>
	  <p>Our thesis is that having brokers send us a high volume of deals will outweigh any possible in-house sales strategy or team.</p>
	  <p>Something we believe in at Ventra is maximizing scalability. The amount of independent brokers sourcing MCA deals in the U.S. is massive. We want to let the pros of sales do what they do best: sell. Our place in the process is to provide competitive offers, rates, and the best user experience for our brokers.</p>
	  <p>We believe 90% of the equation is providing low buy rates, long terms, and the most competitive offers for deals that come in. That way, the product speaks for itself, and our partners naturally gravitate towards pushing more high-quality deals our way.</p>
	  <p>Our CTO and Co-Founder focuses on the other 10% of the equation: having simple, fast tools for brokers that bring personal preference to us.</p>
	  <p>The MCA industry is infamous for "backdooring," or going behind the ISO to provide an offer directly to the merchant, usually with a lower cost of capital due to broker fees being minimized. At Ventra, we know we can't just make "trust me bro" promises and expect ISOs to believe us. Instead, we've created <a href="/our-assurances" class="font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">legal obligations we're bound by</a>, which we believe no other funder offers. And if you're anxious about a deal, we offer fine-grained observability like no other, allowing you and your team to observe every little interaction we take when it comes to the clients you provide us.</p>
	  

  </Section>

  <CtaBand text="" class="[&_h2]:text-black [&_h2]:text-wrap" />
</PageShell>
